  "question": {
    "text": "If the number of principal solutions of the equation&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>π</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> is <math><mi>k</mi></math>, then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>14</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo></mrow></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>14</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mn>10.4</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>9.4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br />Total <math><mn>20</mn></math> values of <math><mi>n</mi></math> and for each value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> their will be two solutions.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>"
